      "body": "## Motivation\n\nDeepSeek-V4.1-Flash PD decode with DSpark on MI355X crashes while capturing the bs=384 decode CUDA graph (2304 verify rows per DP rank):\n\n```\nMemory Fault Error [..., kernel: _candidate_block_scores_kernel]\nException: Capture cuda graph failed: CUDA error: an illegal memory access was encountered\n```\n\n`_candidate_block_scores_kernel` and `_gather_candidate_blocks_kernel` compute `row * logits_stride` in int32. On a 1M-context server the decode logits are `[rows, 1052672]` fp32, so the offset overflows 2^31 from row 2041: every DSpark decode graph from bs=341, and eager verify steps with very long requests.\n\n## Modifications\n\nUse a 64-bit row offset, `row.to(tl.int64) * logits_stride`, in both kernels.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nOnly the address computation changes, so outputs are unchanged wherever the old code did not fault. An offline gfx950 compile shows the offset is now a 64-bit multiply (`s_mul_hi_i32` + `s_mul_i32`) instead of a wrapped i32 product. MI355X validation of both kernels against torch on a `[2304, 1052672]` logits tensor is pending.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nN/A: one extra scalar instruction per program.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [ ] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40830371860](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40830371860)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40830371551](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40830371551)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40830371513](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40830371513)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->\n",
